      "updated": 1735689600000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "VERIFIED ON MAINNET, NOT ASSUMED\nA real versioned transaction simulated against api.mainnet-beta returned all four of these directly.\nNo getMultipleAccounts pre-state fetch, no hand-rolled account diffing. It is the same shape\ngetTransaction meta uses, which SolanaRpcDataSourceImpl already parses for transaction history.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "el0069",
      "originalText": "VERIFIED ON MAINNET, NOT ASSUMED\nA real versioned transaction simulated against api.mainnet-beta returned all four of these directly.\nNo getMultipleAccounts pre-state fetch, no hand-rolled account diffing. It is the same shape\ngetTransaction meta uses, which SolanaRpcDataSourceImpl already parses for transaction history.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
