      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1735689600000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "THREAT MODEL\nphishing brand      -> origin host is the identity\ndisguised payload   -> preview from simulation,\n                       not the dapp's description\nreplay              -> single-use nonce, request id\nstale session       -> expiry + one-tap revoke list\nwallet drain        -> danger flags on approvals\nsign for other key  -> reject if fee payer isn't us\nsilent signing      -> no auto-approve path. ever.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "el0154",
      "originalText": "THREAT MODEL\nphishing brand      -> origin host is the identity\ndisguised payload   -> preview from simulation,\n                       not the dapp's description\nreplay              -> single-use nonce, request id\nstale session       -> expiry + one-tap revoke list\nwallet drain        -> danger flags on approvals\nsign for other key  -> reject if fee payer isn't us\nsilent signing      -> no auto-approve path. ever.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "el0156",
