      "updated": 1735689600000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "MERCHANT STRINGS ARE ATTACKER-CONTROLLED\nlabel, message and icon come from the merchant. Render them as untrusted content;\nthe origin host is the only trustworthy identity. reference keys stay read-only\nnon-signer. https is enforced at parse and that check is not to be relaxed.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
